# Habr Cover Style

For Movie Planner Habr article covers, use the canonical skill from the main Movie Planner bot repo:

`C:\Users\1\Desktop\Movie Planner\wt-mcp-ticket-routing\.cursor\skills\article-cover-format\SKILL.md`

Do not hand-roll a new cover generator in this repo.

Canonical implementation:

- `scripts/build_habr_article_cover.py`
- `scripts/article_cover_theme.py`
- size exactly 780x440
- Unbounded Black/SemiBold from `moviebot/assets/fonts`
- `moviebot/assets/og/icon48.png`
- dark gradient with pink/purple glow
- bottom chips rendered via `article_cover_theme.draw_chip`
- checkmark drawn as lines, not Unicode

For this MCP article, generate the cover by importing `article_cover_theme` from the main repo and writing to:

`assets/movie-planner-mcp-cover.png`
